title: "Asia-Pacific Statistical Analysis System"
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata from this file."
type: software
version: 1.5.1
date-released: "2026-09-21"
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/cpufreestyle/statistical-analysis-system"
url: "https://qu-stat-system.vercel.app"
abstract: >-
  An open economic-statistics workbench for the Asia-Pacific region. Every figure comes from
  official public data (World Bank Open Data, China National Bureau of Statistics, China
  Customs); the AI layer may only interpret those figures and is explicitly forbidden from
  inventing any. Identifiers are localized server-side, so the REST API is bilingual rather
  than only the dashboard.
keywords:
